<title>USA: Telephone and Data stake held by Franklin.</title>
<headline>Telephone and Data stake held by Franklin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Franklin Resources Inc said Tuesday it holds a 9.8 percent stake in Telephone and Data Systems Inc or 5,308,600 series A common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 1,546,300 shares between Dec 23, 1996, and Feb 20 at $34.75 to $37.0036 per share.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake for investment.</p>
<p>Telephone and Data Systems, based in Chicago, Ill., is engaged in the operation of telephone, cellular and radio paging systems.</p>
</text>
